<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Sept c/a swings to 6.1 bln ats deficit.</title>
<headline>Austria Sept c/a swings to 6.1 bln ats deficit.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT    SEPTEMBER   AUGUST	   SEPT 95</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS -6.1 bln    0.4 bln	  -4.5</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance   -9.1 bln   -2.6 bln	  -7.9</p>
<p> Exports			   59.2 bln   62.0 bln	  54.0</p>
<p> Imports			   68.4 bln   64.7 bln	  61.9</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JANUARY TO MONTH IN QUESTION)</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS-36.0 bln  -29.9 bln	 -30.5</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance  -57.3 bln  -48.2 bln	 -57.6</p>
<p> Exports			  558.5 bln  499.2 bln	 535.7</p>
<p> Imports			  615.8 bln  547.4 bln	 593.3</p>
